=2 Walkthrough
* You will need another {@k}{k:Ephramadian gold coin} for this mission.
** Check **Jazaraat's Headstone** at (E-10) in {z:Caedarva Mire} for another coin. (This can be easily reached from {z:Caedarva Mire} HP#1 or the western exit of {z:Nashmau})
* Travel to and approach the **Cutter** to trigger a cutscene. Here are the options for getting there:
** The {i:Arrapago Ring|Arrapago Ring|26235}, purchased with 100 {p:Imperial standing accolades}, will teleport you in front of the Cutter. This is the fastest route.
** Take the {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Caedarva Mire} and run south to zone into {z:Arrapago Reef} at (G-8).
*** Note this is NOT the (G-6) zone to {z:Arrapago Reef} just east of where you teleport in from the {p:Survival Guide}
*** After zoning, head south to (H-8 on Map 5) to find the Cutter.
** Grab an {i:Imperial Silver Piece|Imperial Silver Piece|2185} (or just 200 Standing), take the Runic Portal to {z:Dvucca Isle Staging Point} to {z:Caedarva Mire} (Map 2) and head West to the (F-9) entrance to {z:Arrapago Reef}. You'll have to pay the entrance fee. Once inside, head North to (H-8) to find the Cutter.

* You will end up in {z:Talacca Cove} once the cutscene ends.
** Don't warp away, the next mission is in {z:Talacca Cove}.

